{"questionId":"net-tcp-handshake","locale":"zh-Hans","contentRevision":1,"promptMarkdown":"下图展示的是 TCP 建立连接的过程。第三次握手时，客户端发送的报文段中，**SYN** 位的值是？\n\n![三次握手](asset:tcp-handshake)","assets":["tcp-handshake"],"options":[{"optionId":"o1","contentMarkdown":"1"},{"optionId":"o2","contentMarkdown":"随机值"},{"optionId":"o3","contentMarkdown":"0"},{"optionId":"o4","contentMarkdown":"-1"}],"explanationMarkdown":"第三次握手（ACK）不再携带 SYN，SYN 位为 0。相对地，`ACK` 位在三次握手中除第一次外都为 1。"}
{"questionId":"net-tcp-flags","locale":"zh-Hans","contentRevision":1,"promptMarkdown":"TCP 三次握手的报文段中，可能被置为 1 的标志位有哪些？","options":[{"optionId":"syn","contentMarkdown":"SYN"},{"optionId":"ack","contentMarkdown":"ACK"},{"optionId":"fin","contentMarkdown":"FIN"},{"optionId":"rst","contentMarkdown":"RST"}],"explanationMarkdown":"握手只用到 SYN 与 ACK。FIN 用于断开，RST 用于异常重置。"}
{"questionId":"net-tcp-vs-udp","locale":"zh-Hans","contentRevision":1,"promptMarkdown":"TCP 与 UDP 都是面向连接的可靠传输协议。","options":[{"optionId":"yes","contentMarkdown":"正确"},{"optionId":"no","contentMarkdown":"错误"}],"explanationMarkdown":"**错误**。TCP 面向连接且可靠；UDP 无连接、不保证送达与顺序。"}
{"questionId":"math-derivative","locale":"zh-Hans","contentRevision":1,"promptMarkdown":"已知 $f(x)=x^2$，求 $f'(3)$ 的值（只填数字）。","answerText":"6","explanationMarkdown":"由幂函数求导法则：\n\n$$f'(x)=2x \\Rightarrow f'(3)=6$$\n\n本题按严格默写判分，填 `6` 正确，填 `6.0` 或 `六` 均判错。"}
{"questionId":"math-quadratic-root","locale":"zh-Hans","contentRevision":1,"promptMarkdown":"方程 $x^2-5x+6=0$ 的两个根是？","options":[{"optionId":"a","contentMarkdown":"$x=1$ 或 $x=6$"},{"optionId":"b","contentMarkdown":"$x=2$ 或 $x=3$"},{"optionId":"c","contentMarkdown":"$x=-2$ 或 $x=-3$"},{"optionId":"d","contentMarkdown":"$x=0$ 或 $x=5$"}],"explanationMarkdown":"因式分解：\n\n$$x^2-5x+6=(x-2)(x-3)=0$$"}
{"questionId":"net-osi-layers","locale":"zh-Hans","contentRevision":1,"promptMarkdown":"下列哪些属于 OSI 七层模型中的**下三层**？","options":[{"optionId":"l1","contentMarkdown":"物理层"},{"optionId":"l2","contentMarkdown":"数据链路层"},{"optionId":"l3","contentMarkdown":"网络层"},{"optionId":"l4","contentMarkdown":"传输层"},{"optionId":"l5","contentMarkdown":"会话层"}],"explanationMarkdown":"下三层为物理层、数据链路层、网络层；传输层是第四层。"}
